  "source_kind": "SYNTHETIC",
  "oracle_provenance": "Authored integer sample/counter scenarios: 480 samples / 10 ms = 48 kHz; PDM 3072000 / 64 = 48000. Missing-frame cases preserve endpoint sample/time rate. Timestamp endpoint quantization gives difference +/- resolution. Expected dispositions and review candidates are authored from these equations, not captured executor results.",
